@startuml
title SC-ORD-009 — A service stops after saving and before publishing
participant "Order\n(saga)" as O
participant "Inventory" as I
participant "Payment" as P

O ->> I : ReserveStock
note over I : one transaction:\nreservation HELD,\nStockReserved in the outbox,\nmessage recorded
note over I #ECEFF1 : stops before\npublishing anything
== the inventory restarts ==
note over I : the relay finds StockReserved\nstill unpublished
I ->> O : StockReserved
note over I : marked as published
O ->> P : ChargePayment
note right of O : had it stopped after publishing\nand before marking, StockReserved\nwould be published twice:\nsee SC-ORD-008
@enduml
